{
    "name": "Effect: Nothing But This Station",
    "type": "effect",
    "img": "icons/svg/mystery-man.svg",
    "system": {
        "description": {
            "value": "<p><em>Applied by <strong>Nothing But This Station</strong> to each affected enemy.</em></p>\n<hr />\n<p>Every creature in range hears only you — not each other, not their own spellcasting, not the building coming down. <b>Failure</b> a creature can't communicate, cast with verbal components, or benefit from any auditory effect but yours, and takes a −2 status penalty to all checks; once each, an ally of yours may spend Encore on its behalf to make it reroll a <i>successful</i> check and keep the worse result. For ten minutes you are the only thing being transmitted anywhere, and every Signal who has cast it describes it the same way: quiet.</p>"
        },
